@startuml Commitment Aware Cash Flow
title Commitment-aware cash cap before rebalance
actor User
participant "RebalancePage" as UI
participant "crossWorkspace API" as API
participant "commitmentAwareCashService" as Cash
participant "plannedTransactionRepository" as Planned
participant "crossWorkspaceDataService" as Inputs
participant "currencyConversionService" as FX
participant "commitmentAwareCash core" as Core

User -> UI: Enter reserve floor and request plan
UI -> API: POST /commitment-aware-cash {currency, reserveFloor}
API -> Cash: computeCommitmentAwareCash()
Cash -> Planned: Get active unexecuted bills through day 90
Cash -> FX: Get latest stored exchange rates
Cash -> Inputs: Assemble spendable balances with same rates
Cash -> Cash: Expand bounded recurring occurrences once
Cash -> Cash: Reject missing or stale foreign rates
Cash -> Core: Project lowest end-of-day balance
Core --> Cash: candidateCashCap = max(0, minimum - floor)
Cash --> API: Candidate cap and assumptions
API --> UI: Display projection
UI -> API: POST /rebalance {availableCash: min(candidate, custom cap)}
API --> UI: Proposed buys only
@enduml
